  "description": "The protagonist, Shin Seonhan, graduated from a provincial medical school that has since been shut down, yet manages to land an internship at Yeonguk University Hospital, one of the best hospitals in Korea. One day, after being looked down on for coming from a provincial university, he suddenly begins to see the future of his patients. Now that he has gained the ability to see the future, his arduous life as an intern begins—one where he cannot let his guard down for even a moment. \n\n(Source: Naver, translated)",
